stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> FirstAllocated: broker split and allocation publish
  FirstAllocated --> FirstRollback: cancel wins
  FirstAllocated --> Committed: commit wins
  FirstRollback --> Empty: exact first target absent
  FirstRollback --> Recovery: rollback unconfirmed
  Committed --> Adopted: parent verifies and adopts
  Adopted --> Ready
  Ready --> AddSurface: serialized broker create
  AddSurface --> SiblingAllocated: publish before decision
  SiblingAllocated --> SiblingRollback: cancel wins
  SiblingAllocated --> Committed: commit wins
  SiblingRollback --> Ready: exact sibling absent, existing siblings preserved
  SiblingRollback --> Recovery: rollback unconfirmed
  Ready --> Release: coordinator lock
  Release --> Ready: siblings remain
  Release --> Retire: last exact surface absent
  Release --> Recovery: close outcome unconfirmed
  Retire --> Empty
  Recovery --> [*]: retain durable recovery
